    "body": "<h2 id=\"h_01JG4A8F2RQ746TS4878Y324JG\">You will learn</h2>\n<p>Learn how to use the social links block to feature your social media accounts in emails. </p>\n<h2 id=\"h_01JG4A8F2RN6CZ9FDFT7H2N63X\">Configure your social links</h2>\n<p>Before you add a social links block to an email template, configure your social links in your account’s images and brand library. </p>\n<ol>\n<li>Navigate to <strong>Content &gt; Images &amp; brand</strong>.<br><img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/32281127170715\" alt=\"The Images and brand tab\" width=\"221\" height=\"229\">\n</li>\n<li>Select <strong>Brand</strong>. </li>\n<li>Select the <strong>Social icons</strong> tab.<br><img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/32281127178139\" alt=\"The social icons tab\" width=\"310\" height=\"185\">\n</li>\n<li>Within each dropdown, add in your social media profile URL for the selected platform (e.g., your brand’s Facebook, Instagram, X, and Pinterest profiles). </li>\n<li>If you don’t have a profile for a platform that’s shown, click the trash icon to delete it. </li>\n<li>Click the <strong>Add link</strong> button to add additional profiles. </li>\n<li>Click <strong>Update brand</strong> in the bottom right corner. </li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"bs-callout bs-callout-default\">\n<p>Updating your social icons here will not change any existing social icon blocks (i.e., those that have already been added to a template, campaign, or flow email). Any new social links blocks will use the updated links. </p>\n</div>\n<h2 id=\"h_01JG4A8F2RB1Q2RDG1ACECAHMW\">Add a social links block to an email</h2>\n<p>To add a social links block to an email template: </p>\n<ol>\n<li>Navigate to the editor for any email. </li>\n<li>Drag and drop a <strong>Social links</strong> block into the canvas wherever you’d like to place it (e.g., in the footer).<br><img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/32281152512795\" alt=\"Adding a social links block to a template\" width=\"350\" height=\"151\">\n</li>\n<li>Note the icons, which reflect the social profiles you added to your brand library. </li>\n<li>Use the <strong>Add icons</strong> button to add additional social profiles, if desired. </li>\n<li>To choose a different icon style or size, adjust the selections under <em>Icon styles</em>.<br><img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/32281152517531\" alt=\"Icon style settings\" width=\"379\" height=\"199\">\n</li>\n<li>Optionally, save the block as <a href=\"https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/115005413888\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">universal content</a> to use it in other emails. </li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"h_01JG4A8F2RV3X8ZK5WY0J81CNC\">Use custom icons for social links</h2>\n<p>Klaviyo offers several versions and sizes of icons you can use for social links. However, if you’d like to use your own designs, you can use the <strong>Custom</strong> option to upload your own social media icons. </p>\n<p><img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/32281152521371\" alt=\"The custom icons option\" width=\"305\" height=\"130\"></p>\n<p>If you use a custom icon for one social profile, we recommend using custom icons for all of them. This allows you full control over the size and shape of the icons. If you mix your own icons with Klaviyo’s, you may notice visual alignment issues, since the icons might not be exactly the same size. </p>\n<h2 id=\"h_01JG4A8F2RDVDP993BGN201KBG\">Additional resources </h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/115005258248\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">How to insert your company name and address to an email footer</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/115005083887\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">How to create a base template</a></li>\n</ul>",
    "user_segment_ids": []
  },
